{"title":"住房城乡建设部建筑市场监管司在深圳召开智能建造试点工作推进会","date":"2024-04-26","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">住房城乡建设部建筑市场监管司在深圳召开智能建造试点工作推进会</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:\r\nwindowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">4</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>日，住房城乡建设部建筑市场监管司在广东省深圳市召开智能建造试点工作推进会，贯彻落实全国住房城乡建设工作会议精神，交流研讨各地发展智能建造的经验做法，部署推进智能建造城市试点工作。建筑市场监管司、部科技与产业化发展中心负责同志出席会议并讲话。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">会议围绕深入学习贯彻党的二十大精神和中央经济工作会议精神，传达全国住房城乡建设工作会议关于发展智能建造的部署要求，通报智能建造试点城市<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年度工作情况，对各地发展智能建造的工作成效给予充分肯定，分析试点工作存在的问题和面临的新形势，部署了下一步重点工作任务。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">会议指出，发展智能建造是建筑业转型升级的重要举措和关键路径，经过一年多的试点，各地建立了工作机制，形成了工作成果，探索了工作特色，各项试点任务取得积极进展，在行业内营造了良好的创新发展氛围。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">会议要求，智能建造试点城市要锚定提品质、降成本的目标方向，进一步完善<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年工作计划，并认真抓好落实，充分调动各类市场主体的积极性，提炼一批可推广的实用技术和领先技术，将智能建造新技术新产业落到实处、做出实效，形成一批可感知、可量化、可评价的试点成果，为全行业探索出一套可复制可推广的经验模式，努力打造建筑业高质量发展的标杆。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">广东省、湖北省、安徽省、深圳市、苏州市、台州市、郑州市、西安市交流了发展智能建造的经验做法和下一步工作打算，参会代表共同观摩了智能建造典型工程项目。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.75pt\">18</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt\">个省级住房城乡建设主管部门、<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>个智能建造试点城市的有关负责同志参加了本次会议。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.75pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}